window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After narrowly escaping death, Theo finds himself at the prestigious Phoenixwing Academy, saved by a mysterious woman and Rowan. His world is expanding in ways he never imagined.</p> <p>At the Academy, grueling trials and fierce tournaments push Theo like never before. But with the enchanted crops and mystical tools from his demonic farm, he forges a path to success that others can only dream of.</p> <p>Yet peace is fleeting.</p> <p>Assigned a critical mission alongside Liliana to aid the Canorians, Theo must rely on his demonic farm more than ever. The challenges ahead will push him to his limits, and as enemies close in, long-buried secrets from his past begin to unravel—threatening to shatter everything he thought he knew.</p> <p>In this action-packed third installment of My Demonic Farm, Theo must use every resource at his disposal to survive.</p>"; 
